# GMS deals 130+5x% six times and then poisons for a while on top. Nothing
# here damages over time, so the poison is rolled into the hit and the whole
# thing cut to fit: six attacks of 69% climbing to 105%.
#
# Same cooldown as Flame Orb, so the two trade the swing evenly. Its animation
# is the longer of the pair, which is what keeps it from simply winning.
name: "Poison Breath"
skill_order: 3
description:
  "A poison-attribute attack. Breathes a cloud of poison over the enemies in "
  "front of you."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_FIRE_POISON_WIZARD
max_level: 10
base_delay_ms: 780
max_enemies: 6
lines: 6
cooldown_seconds: 0.5
base { skill_pct: 0.69 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.04 }
